  "title": "Laser-evoked potentials in the human spinal cord and cortex",
  "description": "This dataset contains laser-evoked potentials recorded from the human spinal cord and cortex. It combines electrophysiological recordings to characterize nociceptive responses along the neuraxis. The data are organized in EEG-BIDS format and shared under a CC0 license.",
